  "expected_outcome": "A separate research lab resolves the selected canonical replica item through a presentation-only ItemViewmodelCatalog and HeldItemGripProfileCatalog, applies one transient selected-item state to both first- and third-person proxies, clears both on empty slots, and keeps concrete item mutations server-authoritative.",
